+# Corpus fetching
+
+## Rate limit
+
+The repository records that fetching was rate-limited, but it does not record the
+exact per-domain allowance (number of visits), the window length, or the cooldown
+after a breach. Those values could not be recovered from the repository history or
+the available project records, so they are intentionally left unknown rather than
+estimated.
+
+## Hosts
+
+The corpus manifest records that the files were fetched from
+`raw.githubusercontent.com`. It also records that `grep.app` was used to locate the
+files via GitHub code search, but not to fetch their contents.
+
+No other CDN or mirror host used to fetch corpus files is recorded in the repository
+or the available project records.
